{"meta":{"nbResults":11},"repertoires":{"9382":{"id":9382,"title":"TEDI I MAGICZNA LAMPA  2D DUBBING","url":"\/kup-bilet\/tedi-i-magiczna-lampa-2026-09-18-17-00-11","image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1788095897.jpg","date":"2026-09-27T11:00:00+02:00","availableTickets":218,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-09-27 10:00:00","startAt":"2026-08-30 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-09-27 11:00:00"},"products":[{"id":18,"name":"Bilet normalny 20","rawPrice":2000,"price":"20,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":218}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":972,"name":"TEDI I MAGICZNA LAMPA ","description":"Oli, nieustraszona dwuletnia c\u00f3rka Tadeo, sprawi\u0142a, \u017ce sta\u0142 si\u0119 on \r\nnadopieku\u0144czym ojcem, a urocza Mumia czuje si\u0119 odsuni\u0119ta na bok. Kiedy w\r\n Pa\u0142acu Buckingham znajduj\u0105 magiczn\u0105 lamp\u0119, Mumia prosi j\u0105 o \r\nprzeniesienie w czasie do Paititi w Peru w 1502 roku. Tad, Sara i ca\u0142a \r\nekipa b\u0119d\u0105 musieli pod\u0105\u017cy\u0107 za Mumi\u0105 w przesz\u0142o\u015b\u0107, zanim co\u015b zmieni bieg \r\nhistorii... Podr\u00f3\u017c zabierze ich przez Ocean Atlantycki z Peru do Grecji,\r\n a stamt\u0105d w g\u0142\u0105b Bliskiego Wschodu, a\u017c do jaskini Ali Baby i \r\nczterdziestu rozb\u00f3jnik\u00f3w. ","oryginal_title":"Tadeo Jones y la l\u00e1mpara maravillosa","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"#f8a41e","movieType":"ANIMACJA, KOMEDIA,PRZYGODOWY","director":"Enrique Gato","organizer":"","country":"Hiszpania","year":"2026","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":90,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/\/1788095897.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":9,"name":"NOWA Sala Kinowa","institution_name":"","location_description":"Poprawiona wersja","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Miech\u00f3w","city_id":1121,"zip":"32-200","addresse":"ul. Rac\u0142awicka 10"}},"9383